# Scene2-3-3

; ========================================
; ●シーン2‐3‐3
; ========================================

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:9_1
@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000 Duration:1.2 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.8

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_11_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0
@AutoSave
[PrintTextModified Text:第二天午餐过后。<br>看到蕾雅正要走出餐厅，我喊住了她。|#0203Adv03_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:接下来是放风时间，你们是要推进舞台剧制作进度吧？<br>我也想出一份力，有什么我能做的呢？|#0203Adv03_Hiro001| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:刚才用餐的时候，众人也是围绕着蕾雅<br>一直热烈地讨论舞台剧的事。|#0203Adv03_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:如今，制作舞台剧这件事<br>已经变成把我们联系起来的纽带了。|#0203Adv03_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Default
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile

[PrintTextModified Text:谢谢你能这么快就来帮忙。<br>我想想啊……希罗有什么专长呢？|#0203Adv03_Leia001| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:某种意义上来说，这问题真不好回答。<br>基本上无论什么工作我都有自信能做好。|#0203Adv03_Hiro002| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这样啊，跟艾玛说的一样呢。<br>不管是学业还是运动，各方各面都完美无缺。<br>到手的荣誉数不胜数。|#0203Adv03_Leia002| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Pensive_Closed

[PrintTextModified Text:……艾玛说的？|#0203Adv03_Hiro003| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:是啊。为了让我明白你是多么厉害的人，<br>她跟我说了很多哦。|#0203Adv03_Leia003| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Angry

[PrintTextModified Text:……原来是这样。<br>知道自己不在场时被他人说三道四，<br>不是什么很开心的事。|#0203Adv03_Hiro004| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:抱歉。是我主动去问艾玛的。<br>希望你不要责怪她。|#0203Adv03_Leia004| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:蕾雅垂着眼，一副深感抱歉的模样。|#0203Adv03_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:……我并不打算责怪谁。<br>所以说到底，我该干什么？|#0203Adv03_Hiro005| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:啊啊……<br>要不希罗就先看看其他人<br>在干什么吧。|#0203Adv03_Leia005| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile

[PrintTextModified Text:都看过以后，就选一件感觉自己能做到，<br>或者自己想做的事情去做，你觉得怎么样？|#0203Adv03_Leia006| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:没有异议。|#0203Adv03_Hiro006| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:我接受了蕾雅的提议，<br>观摩了一番各人的工作。|#0203Adv03_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@SetCustomVariable Expression:"chosenAreaFlag = 0"
